  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">一個簡單的模組，讓所有箭矢都能與無限附魔相容。</span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px\">============&nbsp; 展示 &nbsp;============</span><br><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/N_B1uy8i8W8?wmode=transparent\" height=\"533\" width=\"533\"></iframe></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>======================================</strong></span></p><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/all-arrows-infinity-fix/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Mod Loader-Forge-1E2D42\" alt=\"\" width=\"116\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/all-arrows-infinity-fix/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20&amp;gameVersionTypeId=6\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Mod Loader-NeoForge-D7742F\" alt=\"\" width=\"138\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/all-arrows-infinity-fix/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20&amp;gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Mod Loader-Fabric-BCB29C\" alt=\"\" width=\"118\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/all-arrows-infinity-fix/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20&amp;gameVersionTypeId=5\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Mod Loader-Quilt-DC29DD\" alt=\"\" width=\"110\" height=\"20\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/all-arrows-infinity-fix/files/6348984\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Version-1.12.2-ff5900\" alt=\"\" width=\"118\" height=\"23\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/all-arrows-infinity-fix/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=1738749986:70886\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Version-1.16.x-ff5900\" alt=\"\" width=\"118\" height=\"23\"></a> <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/all-arrows-infinity-fix/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=1738749986:73242\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Version-1.17.x-ff5900\" alt=\"\" width=\"118\" height=\"23\"></a> <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/all-arrows-infinity-fix/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=1738749986:73250\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Version-1.18.x-ff5900\" alt=\"\" width=\"118\" height=\"23\"></a> <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/all-arrows-infinity-fix/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=1738749986:73407\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Version-1.19.x-ff5900\" alt=\"\" width=\"118\" height=\"23\"></a> <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/all-arrows-infinity-fix/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=1738749986:75125\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Version-1.20.x-ff5900\" alt=\"\" width=\"118\" height=\"23\"></a> <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/all-arrows-infinity-fix/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=1738749986:77784\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Version-1.21.x-ff5900\" alt=\"\" width=\"118\" height=\"23\"></a></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>功能</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">+</span> 所有箭矢，<strong>包括光靈箭和藥水箭</strong>，都能與無限附魔相容</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">+</span> 也能與大多數模組箭矢相容</span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\">+</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:14px\">若使用 Forge/NeoForge 或 Fabric/Quilt 1.20.5 以上版本，還可與大多數模組弓相容</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>此模組另有資料包版本（若想讓原版客戶端相容）：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/all-arrows-infinity-fix\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">All Arrows Infinity Fix [資料包]</a></p><p>差異：模組版本使用 Mixin 檢測無限附魔並改變遊戲邏輯，而資料包則直接取代無限附魔。若你已有其他修改無限附魔的資料包，則需使用模組版本以維持相容性。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>可設定、平衡的版本：<span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/most-arrows-infinity-fix\" rel=\"nofollow\">Most Arrows Infinity Fix</a></span>。</p><p>喜歡這個模組？您可能也會喜歡 Xtra Arrows（完全相容於 All Arrows Infinity Fix）：&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xtra-arrows\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xtra-arrows</a></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><pre><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>和朋友一起玩這個模組！使用優惠碼 \"jackbusters\" 可享 Minecraft 伺服器託管 75 折優惠。</strong></span></pre><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fjackbusters%253fr%253dAll%2bArrows%2bInfinity%2bFix\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/ba99da02-fd57-4ccc-89a5-9a5bba0922d2.webp\" alt=\"Minecraft 伺服器託管享 75 折優惠\" width=\"900\" height=\"150\"></a></p><hr><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>模組包政策：</strong></p><p>&nbsp;您可自由將此模組加入任何於 CurseForge 上託管的模組包中。</p>",
